{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bush Dog is a game where you herd sheep on different maps, with more sheep  added each round until you run out of time. Where you go again to best your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found a way to get the sheep into the blue area as fast as possible. Each round will increase the amount of sheep\u00a0until the timer runs out on multiple different maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Customisation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player help you make your own\u00a0individual with different patterns, colours and later hats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three maps in the game so far each with their different\u00a0challenges with easy and harder maps. One map build for speed and another map for a greater\u00a0challenge. With Easy, mid and hard difficultly that\u00a0provides different game play. With plans to add more map with more different animal and unique challenges inspired by real life herding.\u00a0   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Road Map Next Update</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more Customization for the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Maps to play: Both hard and easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More different animals like two chickens, cows,\u00a0more sheep and Alpacas</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Devlogs:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Trailer Music Unbreakable by Andy Ray</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941470?t=1770519290","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941470?t=1770519290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941470/1d92876c18aeca821500cd39b0fa748e5ca48b41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770519290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941470/1d92876c18aeca821500cd39b0fa748e5ca48b41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770519290","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3949930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bush Dog is a game where you herd sheep on different maps, with more sheep  added each round until you run out of time. Where you go again to best your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found a way to get the sheep into the blue area as fast as possible. Each round will increase the amount of sheep\u00a0until the timer runs out on multiple different maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Customisation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player help you make your own\u00a0individual with different patterns, colours and later hats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three maps in the game so far each with their different\u00a0challenges with easy and harder maps. One map build for speed and another map for a greater\u00a0challenge. With Easy, mid and hard difficultly that\u00a0provides different game play. With plans to add more map with more different animal and unique challenges inspired by real life herding.\u00a0   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Road Map Next Update</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more Customization for the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Maps to play: Both hard and easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More different animals like two chickens, cows,\u00a0more sheep and Alpacas</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Devlogs:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Trailer Music Unbreakable by Andy Ray</p>","developers":["Redcollarwolf"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941470/ac6e54965d929913a43db43d14c82e6bda5a926f/header.jpg?t=1770519290","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> low<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> low</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941470/1133930355/e8cecc0a302496e6c5480b72bc582a856f8cc305/1758847547/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758855485","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941470/1133930355/e8cecc0a302496e6c5480b72bc582a856f8cc305/1758847547/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758855485","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941470/1133930355/e8cecc0a302496e6c5480b72bc582a856f8cc305/1758847547/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758855485","id":257206517,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206517/6651b8488da6dc066da4ac6cf535d9fbbb269f20/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758855485"}],"name":"Bush Dog","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> low<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> low<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</s